  <!-- EN: the Turks -->
  <BA_Turkic_NobleHouse.label>突厥人</BA_Turkic_NobleHouse.label>
  <!-- EN: the Turks faction inspired by the Medieval 2: Total War faction the Turks. The Turks may very much be relative newcomers to both Anatolia and the Holy Lands, but the impact that they have had upon these realms since they migrated from the steppes east of the Caspian has been profound enough to shake the pillars of the oldest and mightiest neighbouring dynasties. Having seized control of the Abbasid Caliphate from the Buyids, and utterly crushed the Byzantines at Manzikert, the Turks have restored unity to the eastern Islamic region, making them arguably the greatest power Arabia or Persia has seen for centuries.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: The Turks</color></i> -->
  <BA_Turkic_NobleHouse.description>突厥派系受《中世纪2：全面战争》中的突厥派系启发。突厥人或许是安纳托利亚和圣地的相对新来者，但自他们从里海以东的草原迁徙而来后，对这些地区产生的影响极为深远，足以撼动周边最古老、最强大王朝的根基。突厥人从布韦希王朝手中夺取了阿拔斯哈里发国的控制权，并在曼齐克特战役中彻底击溃拜占庭人，重建了伊斯兰东部地区的统一，堪称数世纪以来阿拉伯或波斯地区出现的最强大势力。</BA_Turkic_NobleHouse.description>
  <!-- EN: The Almighty -->
  <BA_Turkic_NobleHouse.deityPresets.0.nameType.type>全能者</BA_Turkic_NobleHouse.deityPresets.0.nameType.type>
